  (text "DIGIDASH MAIN BOARD, REV 3  -  all through-hole (no assembly service): rev 2 (DigiDash2/) with the SMD parts swapped for through-hole ones, two 3 A bucks in place of the 5 A one, and the video decoder on a plug-in module" (at 20 15 0) (effects (font (size 5 5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "4579ce9e-57af-5bdf-b7a2-4e98dd139088"))
  (text "Same outline, slot row, screen headers, holes and rear connector group as rev 2 (the housing fits both). The video section is a 2x10 socket (J8) for a TVP5150 breakout module; CAN transceivers are the DIP MCP2562-E/P. Two layers." (at 20 26 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "97d25ffb-84f1-5216-b202-233bc6668b4d"))
  (text "POWER: J7 (battery, ignition, illumination), reverse protection, TVS, two LM2576HV 3 A bucks (U2: the three screens, U3: everything else), a 3.3 V LDO, switched 12 V" (at 20 45 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "45357b12-94fe-5d3c-bb88-20df951b8fe8"))
