  (text "Two LM2576HV-5.0 (TI SNVS107 figure 1, 100 uH / 1000 uF / 5 A Schottky each): U2 feeds the three screens (+5V_SCR), U3 feeds the board, the slots and the cable ports (+5V). Both ON/OFF pins hang on Q7: low (on) while the ignition is on or a card holds WAKE high. Off, the pins rest at 12V_BATT through 100k (ON/OFF max is VIN)." (at 20 51 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e6a2242b-f318-5e4a-9dcb-ae277cddce54"))
